1
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:07,780
忘了问了 当时疼吗
Oh, I forgot to ask- Did it hurt?

2
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:08,780
什么疼吗
What hurt?

3
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:11,080
你从天堂坠落凡间 接触地面的那一刻
When you fell from heaven and landed on earth.

4
00:00:11,353 --> 00:00:13,465
我才没从天堂...
I didn't fall from- Ah.

5
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:16,560
你是说我像个天使
Because I'm an angel.

6
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:18,558
你嘴巴怎么这么甜
Why are you so sweet?

7
00:00:18,558 --> 00:00:20,583
或许只是因为我心情太好吧
Maybe just 'cause I'm so damn happy.

8
00:00:20,989 --> 00:00:22,920
今天是杰的生日
Today's Ja y's birthday,

9
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:25,763
所以我要带他去夏威夷呆上一整个星期
so I'm taking him to Hawaii for a whole week.

10
00:00:25,763 --> 00:00:28,019
茂伊岛的豪华套房 两人的私密空间
Big suite in Maui. Just the two of us.

11
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:31,080
把曼尼拴在后院 留一大碗狗食给他
Got Manny tied up in the backyard. Big bowl of kibble.

12
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,820
开个玩笑 交给克莱尔和菲尔了
I'm kidding. He's staying with Claire and Phil.

13
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:36,240
此次旅行他完全不知情
This whole thing was a big surprise.

14
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:39,440
我一手包办 订机票 订酒店
I did it all myself- the flight, the hotels.

15
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,340
虽说花了我不少钱 不过绝对值
Cost me a fortune, but it was worth it.

16
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:50,000
尽管说了千万遍 不过还是要再说一遍
In case I forget to say it a few hundred times this week,

17
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:51,400
谢谢你
thank you.

18
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:53,820
生日快乐
Happy birthday!

19
00:00:54,215 --> 00:00:55,742
这 这是搞什么
Wh- What the heck?

20
00:00:56,030 --> 00:00:58,945
-惊喜 爸爸 -全家都会跟我们一起去
- Surprise, Dad. - The whole family's coming with us!

21
00:00:58,945 --> 00:01:00,760
-真的吗 -没错
- They are? - Uh-huh.

22
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:03,263
没错 米奇尔 卡梅隆和莉莉也来
Yes, and Mitch and Cameron and Lily too.

23
00:01:03,263 --> 00:01:05,268
是啊 菲尔正在托运行李呢
Yeah, and Phil- he's just checking the bags. Wow!

24
00:01:05,268 --> 00:01:07,020
可真是...
That's, uh- Wow.

25
00:01:07,020 --> 00:01:08,640
都是歌洛莉亚的主意
It was all Gloria's idea.

26
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:09,960
她把我们机票什么的都包了
She bought all of our tickets and everything.

27
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:11,320
-是吗 所有人的 -没错
- Really? Everyone's? - Yeah.

28
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:13,780
你过生日嘛 该花就得花
It's your birthday. I didn't spare any expense.

29
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:16,854
天啊 谢谢你了 亲爱的
Oh, gee! Thank you, honey.

30
00:01:16,854 --> 00:01:19,385
那他们 都跟我们一起坐头等舱吗
Are they, uh, all gonna be up with us in first class?

31
00:01:19,385 --> 00:01:21,710
傻啊老公 经济舱啦 你当我是摇钱树啊
Ay, no, silly. Coach. You think I'm made of money?

32
00:01:23,020 --> 00:01:24,700
当然不是
Of course not.

33
00:01:41,127 --> 00:01:42,940
我们要吃夏威夷野猪宴
We're gonna go to a luau,

34
00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:44,600
跟迈阿密海豚一起游泳
swim with the Miami Dolphins,

35
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,207
坐着那啥啥环游
take a tour in one of those, the-

36
00:01:47,143 --> 00:01:49,794
-直升飞机 -没错
- Helicopter. Helicopter. - Mm-hmm. Yes!

37
00:01:50,740 --> 00:01:52,140
我不爱参加活动
I don't like activities.

38
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:53,760
我就想跟歌洛莉亚到处转转
I wanted to hang out with Gloria

39
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,580
读一读罗伯特·勒德拉姆的小说
and read my Robert Ludlum novels.

40
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:58,180
我这电子书里存了整整八本
I got eight of 'em loaded up on my book reader thing here.

41
00:01:58,540 --> 00:01:59,639
别误会 我爱我的家人
I mean, I love my family.

42
00:01:59,639 --> 00:02:01,916
共进晚餐啦 吃吃烧烤啦都不错
I love 'em at dinners, I love 'em at barbecues,

43
00:02:01,916 --> 00:02:04,194
但干嘛非要到夏威夷去啊
but do I have to love 'em in Hawaii?

44
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:05,980
谢了 达里尔
Thanks, Daryl.

45
00:02:06,380 --> 00:02:07,740
我知道自己行李[心理]负担不少
I know I got a lot of baggage,

46
00:02:07,780 --> 00:02:09,220
不过别担心 我在看心理医生
but don't worry, I'm seeing a therapist.

47
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:10,780
开个玩笑 我没事
Just kidding. I'm fine.

48
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:16,656
达里尔 我认识这帮人
Daryl, I know these guys.

49
00:02:16,656 --> 00:02:18,503
帽子能借我演个戏吗 肯定会很搞笑
Can I borrow your hat? This will be hilarious.

50
00:02:18,503 --> 00:02:20,103
-不行 -好吧
- No. - Okay.

51
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:22,320
你好啊 菲尔姑父
Aloha, Uncle Phil!

52
00:02:23,380 --> 00:02:24,558
要去旅行了激动吗
You guys excited about the trip?

53
00:02:24,558 --> 00:02:26,840
激动死了 你知道吗 这是我的第一次
Oh, we're so excited. You know, this is my first time.

54
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,480
-真的吗 -是啊 我知道很不可思议
- Really? Yeah, I know it's surprising.

55
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:30,180
大家总说我弥漫着"夏威夷"的气息
People always say I scream "Hawaii."

56
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:31,200
谁说的
Who says that?

57
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:32,820
-一些人 -哪些人
- People. - What people?

58
00:02:33,180 --> 00:02:34,520
说了你也不认识
You don't know them.

59
00:02:36,689 --> 00:02:39,180
-嘿 莉莉 嗨 -噢不
- Hey, Lily! Hi. - Oh, no! Oh, n-

60
00:02:39,180 --> 00:02:40,000
我忘带钱包了
I forgot my wallet.

61
00:02:40,181 --> 00:02:41,605
没事 我有现金
Oh, that's all right. I have cash.

62
00:02:41,605 --> 00:02:44,015
不是 我没带身份证不能登机
No, no. I can't get on the plane without my I.D.

63
00:02:44,540 --> 00:02:46,760
-多亏了你 小卡 -怎么能赖我
- Thanks a lot, Cam. - How is this my fault?

64
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,780
因为早上你要是按我说的做了
Because if you had done what I asked you to do this morning,

65
00:02:48,780 --> 00:02:49,760
我就不会忙得团团转
then I wouldn't have been overwhelmed

66
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:51,120
也不会把钱包落家里了
and I would have remembered my wallet.

67
00:02:54,915 --> 00:02:56,920
好了 还得把莉莉的玩具打包
All right. We still need to pack Lily's toys,

68
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:57,920
打印登机牌
print the boarding passes.

69
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,660
暂停报纸的递送
Oh, stop the newspaper.

70
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:02,180
等等 你在做什么 我刚打包好的
Wait. What are you doing? I just packed those.

71
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:03,860
她穿这身衣裳太可爱了
She just looks so cute in this outfit.

72
00:03:03,860 --> 00:03:05,380
我想要她以最佳状态去见贾斯珀
I want her looking her best for Jasper.

73
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:07,040
你刚说的我一句听不懂
Nothing you just said made any sense to me.

74
00:03:07,180 --> 00:03:08,620
贾斯珀和他妈妈要来跟莉莉玩
Jasper and his mother are coming over for a playdate.

75
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:10,000
我们几周前定好的
We scheduled it weeks ago.

76
00:03:10,060 --> 00:03:12,220
-我们要去机场了 -还有一小时呢
- We're about to leave for the airport. - Not for an hour.

77
00:03:12,220 --> 00:03:13,980
贾斯珀只有这时候有空
And this is the only time Jasper could do it.

78
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,480
贾斯珀是有多忙啊
How full is Jasper's calendar?

79
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:17,541
此乃妙计 只要跟贾斯珀套上近乎
This is a coup. When you get in with Jasper,

80
00:03:17,541 --> 00:03:18,200
万事都轻松
doors open.

81
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:19,797
他可是快乐时光幼儿园里的大明星
He's a legacy at Happy Time Preschool.

82
00:03:19,797 --> 00:03:21,480
我们连10个月大小孩的马屁都要拍吗
We're kissing up to a 10-month-old?

83
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:22,880
我只是希望留个好印象嘛
I just want him to like us.

84
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,760
好了 他们来了
Okay, that's them.

85
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,020
进来坐会儿就得了
But just in and out.

86
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:27,280
还有一堆事要忙活呢
We still have a million things to do.

87
00:03:27,320 --> 00:03:30,040
能放松点吗 你总爱瞎操心 没事的
Would you relax? You always worry. It always gets done.

88
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:36,020
对了 记住 我们是循道宗信徒
Oh, and we're Methodists, so-

89
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:38,040
骗谁呢我 这肯定是赶不上飞机了
Uh, who am I kidding? I'm not making this flight.

90
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:39,760
我开车送你回去
Uh-uh. I can get you home

91
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:42,260
然后飞机起飞前赶回来 走吧
and back before the plane takes off. Let's go.

92
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:45,360
达里尔 想个法子让飞机晚点起飞
Daryl- See if you can stall the plane.

93
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:47,340
这个...我待会儿再付给你
That's- I will get to you later.

94
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,816
我真觉得 真觉得肯定赶不上
I really- I really don't think there's enough time.

95
00:03:49,816 --> 00:03:51,960
去吧 在登机口见 去吧
Go. I'll meet you at the gate. Go.

96
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:54,639
-你不会丢我一人自己去玩吧 -这个
- But you won't get on the plane without me, right? - Oh. Well-

97
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:56,860
真的假的 你打算自己去吗 小卡
Seriously? You were gonna get on the plane? Cam!

98
00:03:56,860 --> 00:03:57,800
你就去吧
Just go!

99
00:03:58,251 --> 00:04:00,489
不行 后面也得关上
Nope. Gotta get that one.

100
00:04:00,589 --> 00:04:02,331
不行 我关不上
Okay. I can't-

101
00:04:02,331 --> 00:04:05,220
-噢 真是慢得要死 -赶紧开
- Oh! That's as fast as she goes. - Just drive.

102
00:04:05,220 --> 00:04:06,840
-赶紧开 -行李交给我吧
- Just drive. - I'll get the luggage!

103
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,880
快瞧瞧那帅哥
Hey, check out that cute guy.

104
00:04:11,715 --> 00:04:14,583
他跟你可不是一路人 他在读书呢
He's out of your league. He's reading a book.

105
00:04:14,940 --> 00:04:15,820
我知道
I know.

106
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:21,660
-就是今天 奔赴茂伊 -看见菲尔没
- Here today, gone to Maui! - Hey. You seen Phil?

107
00:04:21,740 --> 00:04:24,240
-他载米奇尔回家去拿钱包了 -什么
- Oh, he drove Mitchell back to get his wallet. - What?

108
00:04:24,380 --> 00:04:26,180
是啊 他说一定能及时赶回来
Yeah. He said he's gonna make it back in time,

109
00:04:26,180 --> 00:04:27,260
要我看悬啊
but I think it's gonna be close.

110
00:04:28,180 --> 00:04:29,480
他就把我扔这儿了
So he left me here.

111
00:04:31,840 --> 00:04:34,640
海莉还没起来 卢克人也不知道哪儿去了
Haley is still asleep, and I have no idea where Luke is.

112
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,480
你到底准备好了没啊
And are you even ready?

113
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:38,040
我的包都放在客厅了 一切都会没事的啦
My bag's in the living room. Everything's gonna be okay.

114
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:40,480
好吧 抱歉 我有点小紧张
Okay. Fine. I'm sorry. I'm a little tense.

115
00:04:40,700 --> 00:04:42,300
那你还喝咖啡
Coffee'll help that.

116
00:04:42,627 --> 00:04:43,380
你说得对
You're right.

117
00:04:43,440 --> 00:04:46,380
我们不是聊过了嘛 航空旅行非常安全
We've been over this. Air travel is incredibly safe.

118
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:48,120
我知道 我知道的 不过话说回来
I know. I know. But at the end of the day,

119
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:49,560
它就是天空中的一座建筑
it is still a building on its side

120
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,080
横着被扔过来扔过去呗
being thrown from one place to another.

121
00:04:51,180 --> 00:04:52,540
-有电影看 -顶屁用
- With a movie. - Not helping.

122
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:56,720
要不要来点什么药 帮助你缓缓神
You wanna take something, maybe calm your nerves?

123
00:04:56,780 --> 00:04:59,300
不行 孩子们还指着我呢 我要清醒
No. No. I wanna be alert if the kids need me.

124
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:03,480
好伟大的母亲 有时我都希望你能是我母亲
What a mom. Sometimes I wish you were my mom.

125
00:05:03,820 --> 00:05:06,300
天啊 菲尔 我已经有点想吐了
Oh, God, Phil. I'm already feeling a little queasy.

126
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:10,520
我讨厌这种感觉 特讨厌
I hate this feeling. I hate it.

127
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:12,880
越是快上飞机这感觉就会越强烈
And it's just gonna get worse and worse until the flight.

128
00:05:13,460 --> 00:05:14,780
没事的啦
It's gonna be fine.

129
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,340
有菲尔大叔在呢
Uncle Phil's here.

130
00:05:18,420 --> 00:05:20,500
好样的 老弟 第一个准备好的
Great job, buddy! First one ready.

131
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:24,040
海莉 艾丽克斯 要走了
Haley and Alex, let's go!

132
00:05:24,340 --> 00:05:25,240
上帝保佑
Bless you.

133
00:05:25,378 --> 00:05:28,601
-来了 -好的快跟上 姑娘们
- Coming. - All right. Come on, girls.

134
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,798
练兵千日 用兵一时啊
Okay. This is why we practice.

135
00:05:30,798 --> 00:05:32,720
-就来了 就来了 -十五秒的时间
- Come on through. Come through. - Fifteen seconds.

136
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:34,140
-准备好了吗 -准备好了
- Are we ready? - I think so.

137
00:05:34,460 --> 00:05:35,740
动起来吧
It's go time.

138
00:05:36,791 --> 00:05:39,050
直奔小车 欲速则不达 慢慢来
Straight to the car. Slow is smooth, and smooth is fast.

139
00:05:39,050 --> 00:05:41,320
走 走 走 欲速则不达 慢慢来
Go, go, go, go, go. Slow is smooth, and smooth is fast.

140
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:44,524
-太棒了 -很好 快走 快走
- Very nice! -Alright. Let's go. Let's go.

141
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,521
-好像还多余几秒呢 -不多
- I think we got an extra couple of seconds. - No,

142
00:05:46,521 --> 00:05:47,550
-没有 -老爸 赶紧的
- we don't. - Dad, come on!

143
00:05:52,220 --> 00:05:54,280
真想这么抱你一整天
I will never get tired of this.

144
00:05:54,860 --> 00:05:55,460
我也是
Me neither.

145
00:05:55,953 --> 00:05:58,020
老妈知道怎么样才最酷吗
You know what would be cool, Mum?

146
00:05:58,020 --> 00:05:58,560
怎么样
What's that?

147
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:00,459
就是飞机直插入暴风雨
If the plane flew into a storm

148
00:06:00,459 --> 00:06:04,171
然后像《迷失》里那样坠毁在一座岛上
and crash-landed onto an island like in Lost.

149
00:06:12,835 --> 00:06:13,960
哪里不对劲吗 小卡
Something wrong there, Cam?

150
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:15,960
新买的登山鞋磨得我脚生疼啊
Well, I'm just breaking in a new pair of hiking shoes.

151
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:18,460
一向如此 我们家的男人脚踝都比较粗壮
This always happens. All the men in my family have wide ankles.

152
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:21,377
我有个叔叔只能穿喇叭裤 对天发誓
I have an uncle that can only wear bell bottoms. Hand to God.

153
00:06:21,377 --> 00:06:22,544
我相信你
I wasn't doubtin' ya.

154
00:06:22,544 --> 00:06:25,240
只是纳闷儿你为什么要穿个登山鞋
Just why are you wearing the hiking shoes?

155
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:27,300
-惊喜吧 -什么 又来
- Surprise! - What, again?

156
00:06:27,951 --> 00:06:30,760
每天早上整个一家子都要去登山
Every morning the whole family's gonna go hiking.

157
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:31,680
这样一星期下来
Then at the end of the week,

158
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:34,053
我们就都能爬到火山顶了
we all gonna make it to the top of the volcano.

159
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:35,320
每天早上是吧
Every morning, huh?

160
00:06:35,380 --> 00:06:37,225
是啊 当时小卡一提
Yes. When Cam suggested it,

161
00:06:37,225 --> 00:06:38,700
我就知道这主意你肯定喜欢
I knew you were gonna love it.

162
00:06:38,700 --> 00:06:41,058
-原来是你的鬼主意啊 -生日快乐 杰
- Oh, so this was your idea? - Happy birthday, Jay.

163
00:06:41,058 --> 00:06:43,743
谢谢啊 老兄
Ah, thanks, buddy. Ow.

164
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:44,939
小甜心好啊
Hi, sweetheart!

165
00:06:44,939 --> 00:06:47,500
-我要去登山啦 -她在笑啊
- I'm going hiking! - She's smiling!

166
00:06:54,611 --> 00:06:55,618
谢谢
Thank you.

167
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,897
看 老妈 我怀孕了
Look, Mom, I'm pregnant.

168
00:06:57,897 --> 00:06:59,540
好的 不过你还是得吃晕海宁
Yeah. You still gotta take your Dramamine.

169
00:06:59,540 --> 00:07:01,040
这儿谁会晕机吗
Oh, does somebody get a little motion sickness?

170
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:03,960
我能从头吐到尾
Yeah, I throw up all the time.

171
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,700
那你得赶紧吃点晕海宁
Oh, well, then Dramamine's the way to go.

172
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:08,000
你这是想干什么啊
What the hell are you doing?

173
00:07:08,220 --> 00:07:09,700
现在不能让她睡着
Oh, I'm just trying to keep her awake

174
00:07:09,700 --> 00:07:10,900
这样上了飞机她就能睡着了
so she'll sleep on the plane.

175
00:07:11,500 --> 00:07:12,979
没人会喜欢乘飞机碰上个大哭的婴儿
Nobody likes a crying baby on a flight.

176
00:07:12,979 --> 00:07:14,362
烦人得很
It's-It's very stressful.

177
00:07:14,362 --> 00:07:16,660
去年我从纽约飞回来的时候
Uh, last year I flew back from New York...

178
00:07:16,660 --> 00:07:19,400
旁边就有个婴儿吵了一整路
next to a baby who was very upset the entire flight,

179
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,460
备受煎熬啊
and it was hell.

180
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:22,220
我不是跟你一班飞机嘛 我怎么不记得...
I was on that flight with you, and I don't recall-

181
00:07:22,820 --> 00:07:24,795
我知道了 你指的是我
Oh, I get it. You're talking about me.

182
00:07:24,795 --> 00:07:25,780
真好笑哦
That's very funny.

183
00:07:25,780 --> 00:07:27,540
我们没能买到《舞出我天地》的票
Yeah, we couldn't get tickets to Billy Elliot.

184
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:30,920
他就只想能够跳上舞 说的是我
All he wanted to do was dance, and that's my story.

185
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:32,170
叨逼叨了五个小时
Five hours of this.

186
00:07:32,170 --> 00:07:34,149
"我就想能跳上芭蕾"
I just want to dance at the ballet!

187
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:41,600
晕海宁 上次坐飞机之前我吃点这个就好了
Dramamine. Oh, I wish I had that the last time I flew.

188
00:07:42,140 --> 00:07:45,380
跟你说那飞机可是 忽上忽下 忽左忽右
Tell you, the plane was rocking up and down, back and forth.

189
00:07:45,562 --> 00:07:47,660
当时我真以为机翼给折断了呢
I thought the wings were gonna snap off, honestly.

190
00:07:47,660 --> 00:07:49,260
你自己拆吧 用牙咬
you do it yourself. Use your teeth.

191
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:54,740
这是最快的路线吗 怎么不上高速
I-Is this the best way to go? What about the freeway?

192
00:07:54,740 --> 00:07:57,060
放轻松 交给我了
Relax, punkin. I got this.

193
00:07:57,060 --> 00:07:58,340
关键在于要熟悉路线
It's all about knowing the route.

194
00:07:59,251 --> 00:08:00,700
你面前的可是靠蹬三轮车
You're talking to a guy who made his way

195
00:08:00,700 --> 00:08:02,400
挣学费念完大学的
through college by driving a pedicab.

196
00:08:02,660 --> 00:08:04,800
-知道三轮车是什么吗 -知道知道
- You know what one of those is? - Yes. Yes.

197
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:06,600
就是刚刚超过我们的那辆
I just saw one pass us.

198
00:08:07,348 --> 00:08:08,529
-抢答 《邪恶女人》是谁唱的 -啥
- Quick- Who sang "Evil Woman"? - What?

199
00:08:08,744 --> 00:08:09,780
ELO组合[音同Hello]
ELO!

200
00:08:09,780 --> 00:08:12,120
菲尔 你死哪去了
Phil, where the hell are you?

201
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:15,760
我看看 靠 转弯口我给错过了
Uh, let's see. Oh, shoot! I just missed my turn.

202
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:17,920
你这会儿理应呆在这陪着我
You're supposed to be here with me.

203
00:08:18,220 --> 00:08:19,880
告诉过你的 越是接近起飞
I told you, I get more and more freaked out

204
00:08:19,880 --> 00:08:20,939
我就会变得越抓狂
as we get closer to the flight.

205
00:08:20,939 --> 00:08:22,320
是的 不过米奇...
Well, I know, but Mitch- Okay, you know what?

206
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:26,760
我本来还指望你能陪陪我 真是谢谢你了
I was counting on you to be here, so thanks a lot.

207
00:08:32,220 --> 00:08:33,600
她紧张得要疯了
She's pretty tightly wound.

208
00:08:35,020 --> 00:08:36,100
有些人就是天性使然
Some people are just built that way.

209
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,580
你敢开得再慢一点吗
Honestly, could you drive any slower?

210
00:08:39,540 --> 00:08:42,280
猜猜世界最大的风力发电机在哪里
Guess where the world's largest wind generator is.

211
00:08:42,340 --> 00:08:43,560
是不是我身后这个
Is it right behind me?

212
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:46,380
错 在瓦胡岛上[夏威夷群岛之主岛]
Nope. It's on the island of Oahu.

213
00:08:46,660 --> 00:08:48,920
我考虑把它加进我的夏威夷之歌里
I'm thinking about using it in my song about Hawaii.

214
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:49,736
什么歌
What song?

215
00:08:49,736 --> 00:08:52,620
-老妈没告诉你吗 -惊喜
- Didn't Mom tell you? - Surprise!

216
00:08:52,620 --> 00:08:55,520
一大家子准备给你的生日弄个汇演助兴
The whole family's putting on a show for you for your birthday.

217
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:58,860
每个人都要上台表演 菲尔都把木偶拿来了
Everybody's performing. Even Phil brought his dummy.

218
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,300
是不是很棒啊
Isn't that great?

219
00:09:01,244 --> 00:09:03,260
-杰 -抱歉
- Jay? - Oh, I'm sorry.

220
00:09:03,260 --> 00:09:05,160
我只是在想如果我一不小心
I was just thinking how tragic it would be

221
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:06,460
掉进火山可就悲剧了
if I fell into that volcano.

222
00:09:06,700 --> 00:09:07,760
宝贝 别说胡话
Ay, papi, don't say that.

223
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:12,020
待会儿睡 宝贝 待会儿睡
Not yet, sweetie. Not yet.

224
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:17,200
看 真是完美无缺
See? He's perfect.

225
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:19,760
他连买咖啡都不加巧克力的
Look at him getting coffee and not putting chocolate in it.

226
00:09:19,860 --> 00:09:20,820
真是成熟
He's so mature.

227
00:09:20,940 --> 00:09:21,800
那迪兰怎么办
What about Dylan?

228
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:25,140
迪兰可比不上他
Dylan's no that guy.

229
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:27,880
海莉 赶紧的
Haley! Come on!

230
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,740
还有两分钟就要出发了 起床
We're leaving in two minutes! Get up!

231
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:34,720
-我的天啊 -不会吧 已经是第二天了
- Oh, my God! - Oh, no. Is it tomorrow?

232
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:36,820
迪兰 你在这儿干嘛
Dylan! What are you doing here?

233
00:09:36,940 --> 00:09:39,520
我是想走的 但是见你入睡
I was gonna go, but then you fell asleep,

234
00:09:39,520 --> 00:09:40,780
想到你要离开一个星期
and since you're leaving for a week,

235
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,360
我就寻思着能多看几眼就多看几眼
I want to stare at you as long as I could.

236
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,900
赶紧走吧 要不然我爸妈会以为我们做过了
You have to go. My parents are gonna think we did it.

237
00:09:44,900 --> 00:09:45,860
我还想呢
As if.

238
00:09:46,340 --> 00:09:49,360
赶快出去 千万别让别人发现
Get out of the house and make sure that nobody sees you.

239
00:09:51,092 --> 00:09:52,287
我会想你的
I'II miss you.

240
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,500
你这一走 我就像一个
When you're gone, it's like I'm

241
00:09:53,500 --> 00:09:55,580
困在寂寞小岛上的囚犯
this prisoner trapped in a cell of loneliness.

242
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:57,719
说得真好 不过你真得走了
That's beautiful, but you have to go.

243
00:09:57,719 --> 00:09:58,564
好的
Okay.

244
00:10:05,760 --> 00:10:08,564
我讨厌这种感觉 特讨厌
I hate this feeling. I hate it.

245
00:10:08,564 --> 00:10:11,080
越是快上飞机这感觉就会越强烈
And it's just gonna get worse and worse until the flight. - Hey!

246
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,840
没事的啦
It's gonna be fine.

247
00:10:14,420 --> 00:10:16,220
有菲尔大叔在呢
Uncle Phil's here.

248
00:10:16,894 --> 00:10:19,704
-好样的伙计 第一个准备好的 -谢谢
- Great job, buddy! First one ready. - Thanks.

249
00:10:19,799 --> 00:10:21,668
海莉 艾丽克斯 要走了
Haley and Alex, let's go! Coming.

250
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,480
上帝保佑
Bless you.

251
00:10:23,900 --> 00:10:27,060
-来了 -好的快跟上 姑娘们
- Coming. - All right. Come on, girls.

252
00:10:27,060 --> 00:10:27,439
好的
Okay.

253
00:10:27,439 --> 00:10:29,699
-练兵千日 用兵一时 -就来 就来
- This is why we practice. - Come on through. Come through.

254
00:10:29,699 --> 00:10:32,320
-十五秒的时间 准备好了吗 -好了
- Fifteen seconds. Are we ready? - Yes.

255
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:33,220
动起来吧
It's go time.

256
00:10:34,445 --> 00:10:37,077
直奔小车 欲速则不达 慢慢来
Straight to the car. Slow is smooth, and smooth is fast.

257
00:10:37,077 --> 00:10:39,240
欲速则不达 慢慢来 直接走
Slow is smooth, and smooth is fast. Straight through.

258
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:42,360
-太棒了 -赶紧走 赶紧走
- Very nice! - All right. Let's go. Let's go.

259
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:44,441
-好像还多余几秒钟呢 -不多
- I think we got an extra couple of seconds. - No,

260
00:10:44,441 --> 00:10:45,600
-没有 -老爸 赶紧的
- we don't. - Dad, come on!

261
00:11:04,016 --> 00:11:05,280
-我去 -怎么了
- Oh, no! - What?

262
00:11:05,280 --> 00:11:06,600
我的钥匙
My keys!

263
00:11:08,660 --> 00:11:11,718
撑住啊 宝贝 别睡着
Stay awake, sweetie. Stay awake.

264
00:11:11,718 --> 00:11:14,936
瞧 噢不
Whee! Oh, no.

265
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:18,000
房产经纪人培训就是用来对付这个的
This is where your Realtor training comes in handy.

266
00:11:18,442 --> 00:11:22,036
看着像是标准的波特森D型顶锁
Looks like a standard Porter and Sons D-Model top lock.

267
00:11:22,802 --> 00:11:24,820
快速刷一下应该就能打开
One quick swipe oughta pop it.

268
00:11:24,820 --> 00:11:25,560
上去吧
All aboard.

269
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:29,500
-好的 -走起
- Okay. - There we go.

270
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,238
小心一点
Nice and easy.

271
00:11:31,238 --> 00:11:33,822
-你夹痛我了 夹痛我了 -不好意思
- Yeah, you're pinching. You're pinching. - I'm sorry.

272
00:11:34,380 --> 00:11:37,580
经手千万房屋 习得百般技艺
If you show enough houses, you learn all the tricks.

273
00:11:38,056 --> 00:11:40,677
每个房产经纪人可都是深藏不露的大师
Every Realtor is just a ninja in a blazer.

274
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:43,620
一般的小毛贼入室行窃
The average burglar breaks in

275
00:11:43,620 --> 00:11:45,220
会留下各种蛛丝马迹
and leaves clues everywhere,

276
00:11:45,220 --> 00:11:46,100
我可不会
but not me.

277
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,500
哥来无影 去无踪
I'm completely clueless.

278
00:11:50,793 --> 00:11:52,240
我这么重你还吃得消吗
You're sure I'm not too heavy?

279
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:54,320
怎么会 我打彩弹枪穿的护具都比你重
Please, you weigh less than my paintball gear.

280
00:11:54,713 --> 00:11:56,306
-好了 -好嘞 进来了
- Okay. Yup. - There we go. We are in.

281
00:11:56,869 --> 00:11:58,976
下来吧 压到脖子了
Off-load. On we go. Squeezing.

282
00:11:59,167 --> 00:12:01,989
-缓一会儿 -你没事吧
- I'm going for a ride. - You all right?

283
00:12:01,989 --> 00:12:03,510
没事 没事
Yup. I'm good. I'm good.

284
00:12:04,800 --> 00:12:05,760
你在干嘛
What are you doing?

285
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:08,320
提防着下次再有人想破窗而入
Just making it a little tougher on the next guy.

286
00:12:08,605 --> 00:12:10,387
聪明人总是先别人一步 我靠...
You got to get up pretty early- Son of a-

287
00:12:11,020 --> 00:12:12,771
-你没事吧 -我没事
- Are you all right? - Yes, I am.

288
00:12:13,119 --> 00:12:15,640
差点被你们家的救火车搞死
Just, uh, almost killed myself on your fire truck.

289
00:12:15,640 --> 00:12:16,940
那不是我们家的 是贾斯珀的
That's not ours. That's Jasper's.

290
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:17,649
你们认识贾斯珀
You know Jasper?

291
00:12:17,649 --> 00:12:18,451
他爸妈从我这买过一栋房子
I sold a house to his parents.

292
00:12:18,451 --> 00:12:19,139
你们是怎么约到他来家里玩的
How did you ever get a playdate with him?

293
00:12:19,139 --> 00:12:20,619
赶紧走吧 拜托
Let's go! Please, can- yeah. Okay.

294
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:27,000
你瞅瞅 他在素描哎
Look at him. He's sketching.

295
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:30,120
就像泰坦尼克号里的莱昂纳多一样
He's like Leonardo DiCaprio in Titanic.

296
00:12:30,740 --> 00:12:32,260
我打赌他一定是艺术院校的
I bet he goes to art school.

297
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:34,020
你说他是不是在画我俩呢
Do you think he's sketching us?

298
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:37,518
是啊 我"俩"
Yeah. "Us."

299
00:12:37,518 --> 00:12:41,104
于5点30分飞波士顿的航班现在开始登机
Check-in for the 5:30 flight to Boston may board at this time.

300
00:12:41,780 --> 00:12:43,220
对上眼了
And contact.

301
00:12:47,920 --> 00:12:48,760
是迪兰
It's Dylan.

302
00:12:49,640 --> 00:12:52,380
"我被困住了" 哎呦喂 真能折腾
"I'm trapped." Yeah, yeah, yeah. What a drama queen.

303
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:58,920
我们要去"浣赏"鲸鱼
We will go whale washing,

304
00:12:59,020 --> 00:13:00,420
探索热带雨林
explore the tropical forest,

305
00:13:00,540 --> 00:13:01,880
回归大自然
get back into the nature.

306
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:03,385
听起来不错啊
That sounds fun. Mm-hmm.

307
00:13:03,725 --> 00:13:05,579
-谢谢 -不谢
- Thanks. - Thank you.

308
00:13:05,940 --> 00:13:07,439
请注意
Your attention, please.

309
00:13:07,439 --> 00:13:10,667
请曼尼·迪尔加多到22A登机口
Will Manny Delgado please report to Gate 22-A?

310
00:13:10,667 --> 00:13:13,303
曼尼·迪尔加多到22A登机口
Manny Delgado to Gate 22-A.

311
00:13:14,171 --> 00:13:16,960
快看 外公 晕海宁起作用了
Check it out, Grandpa. The Dramamine's working.

312
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:17,760
我一点都不晕
I'm not dizzy.

313
00:13:17,898 --> 00:13:20,118
小心饮料 小鬼
Yeah. Oh, watch the drink, kid.

314
00:13:21,004 --> 00:13:22,797
哦 我的小说
Ooh! Ooh, my Ludlums!

315
00:13:22,797 --> 00:13:24,740
-对不起 外公 -没事 别紧张
- I'm sorry, Grandpa. - All right. Relax, relax.

316
00:13:24,740 --> 00:13:25,900
可能没什么大碍
We might be okay here.

317
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:33,860
上天待我不公 上天待我不公
It's not fair. It's not fair.

318
00:13:36,585 --> 00:13:39,043
抱歉女士 他是曼尼·迪尔加多吗
Excuse me, ma'am. Is this Manny Delgado?

319
00:13:39,043 --> 00:13:41,295
-是的 -你儿子的名字在禁飞名单里
- Yes. - Your son's name is on a no-fly list.

320
00:13:41,295 --> 00:13:43,300
拜托 安检那会儿就跟我们核实过了
Ay, please, we've been through this at the check-in.

321
00:13:43,300 --> 00:13:44,700
他不是名单里的那个曼尼·迪尔加多
He's not the same Manny Delgado.

322
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:47,140
我就是个想重现旅行格调的男孩
I'm just a boy trying to bring style back to travel.

323
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:49,621
-我们只想核实几个问题 -这是个误会
- We just have a few questions to ask. - No, this is a mistake.

324
00:13:49,621 --> 00:13:51,774
-我老公人呢 杰 -这边请 女士
- Where is my husband? Wait. Jay! - Step this way, ma'am.

325
00:13:51,774 --> 00:13:53,148
女士 请这边走
Ma'am, step this way, please.

326
00:13:53,148 --> 00:13:55,741
-孩子 这边走 -杰 别推我 杰
- Son, step this way. - Jay! No pushing. Jay!

327
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:01,240
给我双份的量吧 我一家老小一起旅行
You make it a double? I'm traveling with my family.

328
00:14:01,340 --> 00:14:02,140
没问题
No problem.

329
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:09,560
跟个男人一起生活肯定简单多了吧
Must be a lot easier just living with a guy.

330
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:12,620
我要是同性恋 生活肯定简单得多
Yeah, life would be simpler if I was gay.

331
00:14:13,100 --> 00:14:14,600
你能不能挤进快车道啊[适应这种生活]
Do you think you could get in the fast lane?

332
00:14:14,740 --> 00:14:17,000
-我当然能适应了 -我指的是路
- Oh, I could totally get in the fast lane. - I mean the road.

333
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:20,560
我来了条短信 说的什么
Oh, I'm getting a text. What does it say?

334
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:24,260
哦没啥事 是报警器公司
Um- Oh, G- Well, it's nothing. It's the alarm company.

335
00:14:24,380 --> 00:14:26,440
-说你家有人闯入 -什么
- It says your house was broken into. - What?

336
00:14:26,500 --> 00:14:28,120
没啥事 他们会处理的 你开你的
It's nothing. They'll take care of it. Just drive!

337
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:29,060
到底怎么了
What happened?

338
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:37,060
来玩个有趣的机场游戏
Okay, fun airport game.

339
00:14:37,220 --> 00:14:40,078
随便挑一个旅客 虚构他们的整个人生
You pick out a traveler, you come up with their entire story.

340
00:14:40,078 --> 00:14:41,580
比如这个男人 他叫亨利
Okay. This guy, his name's Henry.

341
00:14:41,580 --> 00:14:43,558
他准备去凤凰城看他的祖母
He's on his way to Phoenix to visit his grandmother,

342
00:14:43,558 --> 00:14:45,939
祖母名叫...
whose name is, uh-

343
00:14:45,939 --> 00:14:47,620
放弃
Oh! Pass.

344
00:14:47,620 --> 00:14:49,098
-太难了 你来 -好的
- Too hard. Your turn. - Okay. Fine.

345
00:14:49,098 --> 00:14:51,340
我看见一个女人 她惊恐万分
I see a woman, uh, wracked with fear,

346
00:14:51,340 --> 00:14:52,460
还被她老公给抛弃了
whose husband has abandoned her.

347
00:14:52,460 --> 00:14:54,195
-哪里 说谁呢 -我
- Where? Where? Who is she? - Me.

348
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:56,880
我跟菲尔说的清清楚楚要他在这陪着我
I made it perfectly clear to Phil that I needed him here.

349
00:14:57,464 --> 00:14:59,467
我也一样 米奇尔也在生我的气
Oh. It's going around. Mitchell's mad at me too.

350
00:14:59,640 --> 00:15:01,180
他觉得就是因为早上我没帮他整理行李
He thinks because I didn't help him pack this morning,

351
00:15:01,220 --> 00:15:02,140
才让他忘带钱包
he forgot his wallet.

352
00:15:02,312 --> 00:15:04,840
对不起 我有一点烦躁
I'm-I'm sorry. I'm sorry to be snippy.

353
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:07,740
我一直在生小卡的气
It's just... I'm a little upset with Cam.

354
00:15:07,820 --> 00:15:10,660
早上打包要他的帮忙 结果他却让我失望了
I needed his help this morning, and he let me down.

355
00:15:11,340 --> 00:15:12,540
我印象中的小卡不是这样的啊
That doesn't sound like him.

356
00:15:12,580 --> 00:15:14,520
你请他帮忙他却不闻不问
You asked him to do something and he didn't do it?

357
00:15:14,820 --> 00:15:17,900
没见他开口说啊 他就在那一直说
But he never asked! I mean, all he said was,

358
00:15:17,900 --> 00:15:19,237
"莉莉的东西要装好
"Lily's bag needs to be packed

359
00:15:19,237 --> 00:15:21,200
报纸要暂停寄送"
and the newspaper needs to be canceled."

360
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,960
我听着就像是在向你求助啊
That sounds to me like he was asking for help.

361
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:25,720
我听着你简直就是想让他能通灵啊
Sounds to me like you expected him to read your mind.

362
00:15:26,500 --> 00:15:29,700
-当我有超能力啊 -不是说让你有超能力
- What am I, a psychic? - No! It's not about reading minds.

363
00:15:29,760 --> 00:15:31,420
是说要了解另一半的需要
It's about knowing what your partner needs.

364
00:15:31,560 --> 00:15:33,960
不如这样 直接说"帮我个忙"
Here's an idea: Just say "Help me."

365
00:15:34,500 --> 00:15:36,214
"我"都可以省了 "帮个忙"就好
You don't even have to say "Me," Just "Help."

366
00:15:36,214 --> 00:15:37,940
这样他就明白你到底要什么了
Then he'll know exactly what you want.

367
00:15:37,940 --> 00:15:38,840
你也不至于憋一肚子气
You won't have to get all mad.

368
00:15:38,940 --> 00:15:41,240
倒没憋一肚子气 只是...
I'm not mad. It's just-

369
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:44,120
你总是希望能和一个人心有灵犀
You wanna believe you're on the same wavelength as someone,

370
00:15:44,120 --> 00:15:45,260
可到头来
and then it's just-

371
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:48,880
发现其实没那么默契时 总有点沮丧
it's a little disheartening when you find out you're not.

372
00:15:49,020 --> 00:15:49,620
就这样
That's all.

373
00:15:50,820 --> 00:15:53,400
最难受的是我明明愿意为他付出所有
What's frustrating is I would do anything for Mitchell,

374
00:15:54,420 --> 00:15:56,480
可他却看不出来 说实话我有点伤心
and-and frankly, it's a little hurtful that he doesn't know that.

375
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:02,260
机场可真吵杂啊
So, airports, huh?

376
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:03,640
是啊
Yeah.

377
00:16:04,980 --> 00:16:06,480
你在画什么呢
Are you drawing something there?

378
00:16:07,481 --> 00:16:09,553
恩 画得一般般啦
Yeah. It's no good.

379
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:11,620
内心纠结的艺术家 妙极了
Tortured artist. Classic.

380
00:16:12,460 --> 00:16:13,580
是啊
Oh, yeah.

381
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:18,440
-是个机器人 -可不是嘛
- It's a robot. - Oh, yeah. Sure is.

382
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:20,660
-背后那个是什么 -一只恐龙
- What's behind him? - A dinosaur.

383
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:23,600
学校的作业 让我们画连环画
It's for school. We're supposed to make a comic strip.

384
00:16:24,020 --> 00:16:25,780
我们也要做哎 就八年级那会儿...
We had to do that too, back in the eighth-

385
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:31,100
他才14岁
He was 14 years old.

386
00:16:31,140 --> 00:16:31,780
闭嘴
Shut up.

387
00:16:32,257 --> 00:16:34,767
"他是我的灵魂伴侣"
"He's my soul mate."

388
00:16:36,118 --> 00:16:37,420
我...
I d-

389
00:16:43,882 --> 00:16:45,428
以下是最后一遍登机通告...
This is the final boarding announcement for-

390
00:16:51,260 --> 00:16:52,000
你在喝什么
What you drinking?

391
00:16:53,300 --> 00:16:54,700
爸 好啊
Dad. Hey.

392
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:58,620
大部分是汤力水 要谢谢这位大哥
Mostly tonic actually, thanks to my new sponsor here.

393
00:17:00,220 --> 00:17:01,620
我一想到坐飞机就心里发憷
I'm a little jittery about flying.

394
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:03,900
你在说什么呢 你乘过很多次飞机了啊
What are you talking about? You fly all the time.

395
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:06,777
是啊 也就这几年开始的
Yeah, I know. This started just in the last couple years.

396
00:17:06,777 --> 00:17:08,920
我觉得 之所以会紧张
I think I'm just- I'm nervous

397
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:10,560
可能是因为现在有很多东西放不下吧
'cause I've got so much to lose now, you know?

398
00:17:11,020 --> 00:17:11,900
你是怎么回事
What about you?

399
00:17:12,100 --> 00:17:13,600
来喘口气 不用想着度假的事
I'm taking a break from my vacation.

400
00:17:13,914 --> 00:17:15,429
度假可还没开始呢
We haven't even started yet.

401
00:17:15,429 --> 00:17:18,280
我是觉得吧 真到那个时候我就没个清静了
Well, I gotta figure, I might not have a lot of time for myself,

402
00:17:18,280 --> 00:17:20,700
一会儿烤猪宴 一会儿爬山 一会儿表演
you know, what with the luaus, the hiking, the talent shows.

403
00:17:20,860 --> 00:17:22,420
我们一大家陪你来 你不开心吗
Are you not happy that we're coming with you?

404
00:17:22,420 --> 00:17:24,140
只是跟我的初衷有些不一样
It's just not what I expected.

405
00:17:24,702 --> 00:17:28,260
不过老爸 我们这样你难道不感动吗
But, Dad, doesn't it feel good to know...

406
00:17:28,260 --> 00:17:32,400
一家人都甘愿抛下一切来陪你
that your whole family is willing to drop everything to be with you,

407
00:17:32,460 --> 00:17:35,500
还必须坐那铁棺材横跨大洋
to fly across the ocean in a steel coffin?

408
00:17:35,500 --> 00:17:36,520
你那杯剩下的也给我吧
I'm gonna finish that.

409
00:17:37,280 --> 00:17:39,200
跟你们无关 我爱全家
It's not you guys. I love the family.

410
00:17:40,320 --> 00:17:43,400
我是感觉歌洛莉亚在想方设法地
It just kinda feels like Gloria's going out of her way...

411
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:45,800
避免跟我单独相处
not to spend time with me.

412
00:17:47,292 --> 00:17:48,755
你不是认真的吧
You don't believe that, do you?

413
00:17:49,300 --> 00:17:51,000
拜托 老爸
Oh, come on, Dad!

414
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:54,260
你真是太傻太可爱了
That is so crazy and so adorable.

415
00:17:55,360 --> 00:17:57,440
那女人是爱你的
That woman loves you.

416
00:17:59,303 --> 00:18:00,978
我又没说我不招人爱
Well, I didn't say I wasn't lovable.

417
00:18:02,540 --> 00:18:04,960
不是每个做老婆的都愿意花钱
It's not every wife that would spend the money

418
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:06,360
让全家去夏威夷旅游的
to fly a family to Hawaii.

419
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:10,400
好吧 你们以为歌洛莉亚的钱哪里来的啊
Okay. Where does everybody think Gloria's money comes from?

420
00:18:13,900 --> 00:18:16,220
你之前在日本从事什么活动
So, what kind of business did you have in Japan?

421
00:18:16,620 --> 00:18:17,880
我压根就没去过日本
I've never been to Japan.

422
00:18:18,120 --> 00:18:19,240
你在2003年的11月
You didn't go to Osaka

423
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:21,740
有没有去大阪参加电子贸易展
November 2003 to attend an electronics trade show?

424
00:18:22,380 --> 00:18:23,200
那时我才4岁
I was four.

425
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:26,000
够了 你怎么不去门口随便抓个人来盘问
Enough. Why don't you question the other people on the gate, huh?

426
00:18:26,260 --> 00:18:28,020
看到那个拄着拐杖的老妇人了吗
Did you see the old lady with the cane?

427
00:18:28,180 --> 00:18:29,660
那拐杖里说不定藏了个
What if she has a ceramic knife

428
00:18:29,660 --> 00:18:31,340
金属探测器查不出来的陶瓷刀呢
in there that can go through the metal detector?

429
00:18:31,620 --> 00:18:34,279
你却在这里把时间浪费在骚扰小孩子上
And yet you waste your time harassing a little kid.

430
00:18:34,279 --> 00:18:36,725
女士 你似乎非常了解
Ma'am, you seem to know an awful lot about

431
00:18:36,725 --> 00:18:38,800
如何偷带违禁品上飞机啊
sneaking contraband on to a plane.

432
00:18:38,800 --> 00:18:40,240
是啊 姐可是哥伦比亚人
Yeah, I'm Colombian.

433
00:18:40,520 --> 00:18:41,680
那你有没有去过日本呢
Have you ever been to Japan?

434
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:44,055
我想先打一通电话
I would like to make a phone call.

435
00:18:44,055 --> 00:18:47,080
女士们先生们 飞往茂伊岛的航班
Ladies and gentlemen, preboarding for our flight to Maui...

436
00:18:47,080 --> 00:18:48,440
马上开始办理登机
will begin in the next few minutes.

437
00:18:48,940 --> 00:18:51,500
-卢克 快别转了 -对不起
- Luke, please stop spinning. - Sorry.

438
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:54,140
能不能让机场也别再转了
Now make the airport stop spinning.

439
00:18:54,620 --> 00:18:56,360
我们做到啦 克莱尔
We made it! Claire!

440
00:18:56,540 --> 00:18:58,720
谢天谢地 你终于来了
Oh, my God. Thank God you're here.

441
00:18:58,960 --> 00:18:59,900
亲爱的
Oh, honey!

442
00:19:00,420 --> 00:19:02,980
-真是对不起 -都是我不好
- I am so sorry. - It was my fault.

443
00:19:03,140 --> 00:19:04,940
-不是你的错 -我应该想到你要什么的
- It wasn't your fault. - I should have known what you wanted.

444
00:19:05,628 --> 00:19:08,224
-你是不是喝高了 -有点吧
- Are you drunk? - Kinda.

445
00:19:09,319 --> 00:19:11,373
有次我去墨西哥的坎昆玩了一周
And once I spent a week in Cancún,

446
00:19:11,540 --> 00:19:13,900
要我说 远远没有传说得那么好玩
which, by the way, did not live up to the hype.

447
00:19:17,720 --> 00:19:19,140
来个人跟我解释一下这是怎么回事
Can somebody tell me what the hell is going on?

448
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:20,440
我们就快问完了 先生
We're almost done here, sir.

449
00:19:21,040 --> 00:19:24,300
-你和你的儿子计划一同旅行是吗 -是的
- So you and your son are traveling together? - Yes.

450
00:19:24,560 --> 00:19:26,460
那为什么你们离开茂伊岛的时间不同
Then why are you departing Maui on different dates?

451
00:19:28,140 --> 00:19:31,660
因为他要和一大家子先回来
Well, because he's traveling back home with his family.

452
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:34,340
-什么 -惊喜
- What? - Surprise!

453
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:36,600
他们只在那呆6天
They're only staying for six days.

454
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:39,100
-剩下来的时间只属于我们俩 -真的吗
- The rest of the time it's only you and me. - Really?

455
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:42,360
嗯呀 我就想跟我老公单独待一会儿
Mm-hmm. I wanted to spend some time alone with my husband-

456
00:19:42,680 --> 00:19:45,800
在泳池边上喝点鸡尾酒啊 睡睡懒觉
drink cocktails by the pool, sleep in.

457
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:50,340
我现在已经爱你到无以复加了
I could not love you any more than I do right now.

458
00:19:50,738 --> 00:19:53,445
我还找到了一个裸体沙滩
I also found a topless beach.

459
00:19:53,700 --> 00:19:54,640
那我只能更爱你了
I was wrong.

460
00:20:01,560 --> 00:20:03,200
杰克逊先生 旅途愉快
Mr. Jackson, have a great flight.

461
00:20:03,259 --> 00:20:05,413
请走左边 真漂亮
It's to the left. Oh, gorgeous!

462
00:20:05,413 --> 00:20:07,420
-谢谢 是复古衫 -他是在说莉莉吧
- Oh, thank you. It's vintage. - Think he meant Lily.

463
00:20:07,420 --> 00:20:08,361
你又说不准
You don't know that.

464
00:20:08,361 --> 00:20:10,839
五点钟方向有个适合你的帅哥哦
Hey, there's another hottie for you at 5:00.

465
00:20:11,740 --> 00:20:13,280
他想必应该是个艺术家
I think he's an artist.

466
00:20:13,820 --> 00:20:14,700
是"观赏"鲸鱼
It's whale "Watching."

467
00:20:16,120 --> 00:20:17,640
-"浣赏"鲸鱼 -"观赏"
- Whale washing. - Watching.

468
00:20:18,381 --> 00:20:19,802
-"浣赏" -差不多了
- Washing. - That's close enough.

469
00:20:20,340 --> 00:20:21,820
旅途愉快 先生
Have a good flight, sir.

470
00:20:22,260 --> 00:20:23,420
快 扮个僵尸给人看看
Quick, do your zombie impression.

471
00:20:23,940 --> 00:20:26,160
-她不是喝醉了吧 -没有没有
- She hasn't been drinking, has she? - Oh, no, no, no.

472
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:29,130
她在搞笑呢 再来一个"僵尸抱"
She's- She's hilarious. Okay, let's do bride of Frankenstein.

473
00:20:31,450 --> 00:20:33,530
真是太 太逼真了
It's so, so good.
